{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_028_02_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:ce4f30ce6f5f1b694afd06f2695367f0c4345c7757193207bfc5925b307a6e23",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_e:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9d0a6e6cd6c6876e9e1f430fb0bf0a10d1d10a42e0851941e1fe41c622f9f11",
      "text": "铛铛——！是Cafe Parade特制的\n特别生日蛋糕哦☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4c7c035776bc25342656aab256951aa069ffd0142a8f628293332f26253be95",
      "text": "里面凝聚着我们的心意！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_e:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:203e37f62ec0a53a018f55718faba3121d0349b2fef399c7cececab1b100325a",
      "text": "这是……点缀着许多鲜花的蛋糕呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_e:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86b4efe000219434966a7a5bda175aaedab192232b937de2881b7abd7010ad77",
      "text": "是东云的生日花哦。\n大家一起画出来的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_e:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3aaa6c36b013cc38bb18680bf0bb2f05befb9fbc748266a68ad68c8f5b0736f0",
      "text": "嗯，倾注了吾等的魔力！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_e:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95432b577690e2854cd72a472a29cdd42fd5d86fdfcc9a11b11ea217faf2d7ea",
      "text": "是大家倾注了心血完成的力作！\n每天都有在练习哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_e:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5d60c719b0dcd5778984e7aed76dad3f5e764d8966ff07cb77ad03f68787e53",
      "text": "这朵花是制作人画的！这边是\n我画的花！啪噼地努力过啦～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_e:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d14347bf0fef0baae5a00fa568a6b7083cf83600716e8e1a2b8dbe1647ad7de",
      "text": "海绵蛋糕也是力作哦。得到了卷绪的认可，\n肯定能让你赞叹不已的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_e:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f13d6172e26b52ba554a06b4dd6b518ce98cb8d3b0ab1e929f761029878c1532",
      "text": "那我就来切蛋糕了。\n……来，最大的一块给庄一郎先生！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_e:cmd-000151:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09151d923b8d5e88e0c62d6f39b221e15389c12ddda06511888fca8d7945b045",
      "text": "谢谢大家。\n那么，我立刻就来尝尝。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_e:cmd-000166:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f689e28b6ae11e9b60a217945fa2a45481be4c7c199f75eb09dca6d62cb39a55",
      "text": "……真美味。不仅是味道，\n大家的心意我也切实感受到了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_e:cmd-000172:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9c580433e06a78ebb434f105f3f355c4521e1ff58cbb7616a66b084ac00cba4",
      "text": "谢谢你们回应了我的心愿。\n这成为了我一生的美好回忆。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_e:cmd-000202:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5cf6da8f4de60d987573bc53b638669d0b126b3c544c334669c4d939273e6e80",
      "text": "那真是太好了。再次祝你生日快乐。\n希望你的接下来这一年，能够过得很棒。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
